Ek Tarfa

Unka nazar ana toh mahej ek itafak tha. 
Bina puche unki nazar utarna 
Bas isi jurm ka toh mei gunhegar tha 

Unki nigahen padhne ki adat thi Hume 
har khamoshi me labj dhundna ki chahat thi 
Jis gali woh gujarti har gali mei pehchanta hu.
Aj bhi unke itra ka ilam mei bakhubi janta hu .

Ek Roz humne ek khwab dekha
Unke hatho me apna hath dekha 
Kuch keh Rahi thi woh mujhse
Sun pata kuch usse pehle Mera khawb tuta. 


Har mohabbat ki tarah jisse dhundhta rehta tha mei hakikat aj ye bhi dafan hua meri shariyon me kuch Aisa ki
"Kuch waqt ke liye h sahi 
 Woh ibadat thi meri
 Iftarfa h sahi 
 Par mohabbat thi woh meri"


Tujhe bhulne ki kosis me ek bhul jarur karunga ki mei "Har shayari tere liye likhunga bas tere naam kabhi na likhunga".....